-- Simple VDM++ template
-- This class demonstrates the basic structure of a VDM++ class definition.
-- In VDM++, all definitions must live inside a class.

class SimpleClass

operations

    -- Operations in VDM++ can read and write state.
    -- This operation is pure (no side effects), but defined as an operation
    -- so it can be called from the interpreter with 'new SimpleClass().Add(...)'.
    public Add: nat * nat ==> nat
    Add(a, b) ==
        return a + b;

end SimpleClass